kdna-web-server supplies a reference Host and public Read HTTP adapters
for Node.js, Next.js and Express. Core and Read own admission,
interpretation and disclosure; the embedding supplies independent policy
and a truthful delivery boundary.

Responses preserve public Read results and their proof limits. The current
package has no decryption, activation, LoadPlan or action-execution API,
and does not grant authority from asset content or client-supplied fields.

